  "solution": "Let us check each option:\n\n1. Option 1: 7 × 9 – 8 ÷ 2 + 6\n\nAfter interchanging: __7 - 9 ____× 8__ ÷ 2 + 6 \n\n⇒ 7 - 9 × 8 ÷ 2 + 6 \n\n⇒ 7 - 9 × 4 + 6\n\n⇒ 7 - 36 + 6\n\n⇒ 13 - 36\n\n⇒ -23\n\n2. Option 2:8 × 6 – 9 ÷ 3 + 10\n\nAfter interchanging: __8 - 6 ____× 9__ ÷ 3 + 10\n\n⇒ 8-6×3+10\n\n⇒ 8-18+10\n\n⇒ 0\n\n3.Option 3:16 – 4 ÷ 2 + 8 × 1\n\nAfter interchanging: __16 × 4__ ÷ 2 +__ 8 - 1__\n\n⇒ 16×2+8-1\n\n⇒ 32+8-1\n\n⇒ 40-1\n\n⇒ 39 \n\n4.Option 4:5 + __7 × 3 – 4__ ÷ 2\n\nAfter interchanging: 5+__7-3 ×4__÷2\n\n⇒ 5+7-3×2\n\n⇒ 5+7-6\n\n⇒ 12-6\n\n⇒ 6\n\nHence, the correct answer is **Option (2).**",
